netmalper (8.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Bumped the release to v8.0.0.
  * Added --stealth to skip RustScan and use Naabu followed by Nmap deep scanning.
  * Switched Amass to active mode by default and passive mode in stealth mode.
  * Kept socket/full-Nmap fallback scans gated until the primary scanner fails.

 -- Mithun Krish <mitchastertheblaster@gmail.com>  Sun, 24 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000

netmalper (6.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Bumped the release to v6.2.0.
  * Fixed RustScan timeout handling so partial output survives TimeoutExpired.
  * Normalized subprocess output decoding to avoid bytes/str crashes.

 -- Mithun Krish <mitchastertheblaster@gmail.com>  Sat, 23 May 2026 15:44:50 +0000

netmalper (3.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of NetMalper.
  * Migrated port discovery to RustScan with socket fallback.
  * Added Debian wrapper for nofile limit handling and RustScan tuning knobs.

 -- Mithun Krish <mitchastertheblaster@gmail.com>  Sun, 19 Apr 2026 13:30:00 +0530
